status-observed-down — as status-observed-degraded with the streak at the limit (3): DOWN, reason
probe-failed. (A hold would need watch.hold; that world is watch-pin-held.)
The stamps are in 2100 so the record counts as fresh whenever the gate runs (freshness is one-sided: a
future stamp is fresh; on a real box the next tick overwrites it within an interval). Both sides read the
same files and make the same clash API reads, and for the plain `status` neither probes: the trace
shows no delay test (`--probe`, where a case has it, is the exception).
